{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LPZAyJkA_D21AEm0A0Fl0A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:23.325157+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LPZAyJkA_D21AEm0A0Fl0A","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nSn2OpYoibfG8wJRwXb0jZSR6Cc8ibwPbLKNLptFuug6s5aLQaCqygzcVOSjTDxuGPuXibXiae7GsXOM7ezJMlcGQQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>医院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uCo3BrN4ATokgS3c0xpnS5ulzpXAMomwITVdICVNat0WmdNC1Gsp4MSS5k2C2Pxjlqs7onOsvj9d2V8KDX1ibcU5ic2eumBeXhREiafbLC66ibw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>山东第一医科大学第一附属医院（山东省千佛山医院）成立于1960年，目前已建设成为一所集医疗、教学、科研、康复、保健、预防、急救于一体的省级大型综合性三级甲等医院。医院先后荣获“全国百姓放心示范医院”“全国医院文化建设先进单位”“省级文明单位”“人文爱心医院”等多项国家级、省级荣誉，并连续六年在国家卫生健康委三级公立医院绩效监测中取得A+等级。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>目前，医院建筑总面积30万余平方米，开放床位3000张。现有在职人员4341人，副高级以上专业技术人员923人。人才梯队结构完善、高层次人才储备雄厚，拥有国家杰出青年科学基金获得者2人、长江学者奖励计划特聘教授2人，享受国务院特殊津贴、国家卫健委突出贡献专家11人，享受省政府津贴、省突出贡献专家5人，泰山学者24人，齐鲁卫生与健康人才32人，省医学会、医师协会等省级学会分会主任委员以上200余人。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>学科综合实力突出，医院拥有7个国家临床重点专科、28个省临床重点专科，具备心、肝、肾、肺、胰腺等器官移植资质，2025年器官移植手术量位列全国第五、全省第一。微创外科（腔镜/机器人手术）、心血管介入、神经免疫疾病诊疗等特色技术稳居省内前列。近五年，医院承担国家自然科学基金项目108项，发表 SCI 论文 2000 余篇，科研经费充足。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>教学体系日益完善。作为国家级专科医师规范化培训基地（涵盖心血管病学、普通外科学）及住院医师规范化培训基地，医院构建了网格式教学管理体系，严格执行师资准入制度，并强化师资培训工作。现有博士生导师85人、硕士生导师394人、临床带教老师1200余人。近五年，累计培养博士、硕士研究生1000余名，多人次荣获国家奖学金、山东省优秀毕业生、省级优秀学生干部及优秀学术成果等荣誉。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>面向未来，医院以建设“国内一流研究型强院”为目标，持续深化医教研协同发展，依托医联体平台辐射基层医疗，持续提升疑难重症诊疗与医学转化能力，全力服务健康山东、健康中国建设。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 夏令营简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uCo3BrN4ATpnKWT6GSmnB62PlqysJjwkNXj3mZqMUSIlnOicmC4qtn8ia7EhRialONceDWSAUeIJ5kuuOpZ1WjmrYea9sZPut9gOFbmxmCpeE0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为增进大学生对医院的深入了解，促进优秀大学生之间的互动交流，优化研究生生源结构，提升生源选拔质量，同时为热爱科研、基础扎实、素质全面、德才兼备的应届本科毕业生提供继续深造和发展的平台与机遇，医院特举办2026年硕士研究生招生夏令营活动。本届夏令营中表现突出的营员，将荣获“山东第一医科大学第一附属医院暑期夏令营优秀营员”称号。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>3</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 招生规模及组织形式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/uCo3BrN4ATqIw1N4lLic0ibpI2eYiaND74JicMWR6RiakcItGibiatMHKmLxfOhWjP4NoX1ApFRSKvjT3YSaT8Fu6oC9LFS1GWE43QnWxdZbQKFTKQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）招生规模</span></p><p><span>夏令营活动计划招生50人，最终人数将根据实际报名情况灵活调整，并秉持择优原则进行选拔。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（二）组织形式</span></p><p><span>本次夏令营活动将采取线下形式进行，具体安排请关注后续通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>4</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uCo3BrN4ATp1hiccDmfaNGW52YkibvqjWrDlu558xybX7ZicmfqHYVdibncMTjsKKb08WnDQPazjy8BHn4NRDiawSvibja9KNeib9G9pfRfqjuzfibQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好、遵纪守法、诚实守信，身心健康且有志于在相关专业领域提升自身科学研究和实践能力的2027届全日制本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.英语水平优秀。满足以下之一：CET4≥425分；或托福≥85分；或雅思≥6.0。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3.学习成绩排名前列，能够获得所在学校推荐免试资格；或有志参加山东第一医科大学第一附属医院研究生招生考试的学生（原则上本科阶段的学业成绩排名在本专业前30%）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4.对所报考专业或相关创新性科研工作有浓厚兴趣。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>5</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 报名时间及流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uCo3BrN4AToNPK5eQo13jzZBJ6sG2FqI0zQGHXNGF3D82efic3GHpKGkeoibGYAWYS7Iz6dg9PIkY6dokW9bqw9icibEobZQIX8mwoFQfdCNMnE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）报名时间：2026年7月6日—7月26日。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（二）报名流程：</span></p><p><span>1.登录山东第一医科大学研究生报考服务系统https://yjszs.sdfmu.edu.cn/，按要求完成报名信息填写。</span></p><p><span>2.提交材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）学生证、身份证扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（2）个人电子照片：近期拍摄，正面免冠彩色照片；</span></p><p><span>（3）夏令营申请表（需签字盖章，上传扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>（4）本科成绩单（需加盖教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>（5）英语成绩证明：英语四级成绩单、TOEFL成绩、GRE成绩等证明材料扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（6）科研成果相关证明材料：申请人可提交体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果及获奖证书。无科研成果者可不提交本项材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>6</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 资格审核</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uCo3BrN4ATrj7PoXxsjnfwg6g1fAwqKOAKAsG7YPNuNE6sibywbfc7C68ibVtksMk4n5TOM9awYRqPUwRRiczBCXJ4cZNb2klo0CV80tiaOXDPg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>医院以教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质为主要评价依据，对申请者进行资格评审。入营合格者名单将在7月下旬或8月上旬在山东第一医科大学第一附属医院官网公布，并以电子邮件或电话形式通知大家。未收到入营通知皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>7</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 活动内容</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/uCo3BrN4ATqZdcqmp1sYhDf9jjBQzK0IDaDzZ8xwROmBg9SHugia2EjPND4zV1PBtibYS07MMIWzhBKnq96GdbdmfXP0NCCpaM6ibiaic1UwaCFU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>活动举办期间，将全面介绍我院及研究生教育情况、实验室及科研平台、招生政策、优势学科团队、导师队伍等。另外参观院内优势学科、实验室平台、举办名师交流活动等。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>8</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 相关事项说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uCo3BrN4ATrFGUm3qk0roza6XAXNxtfmMia3ctZgCbLEpZnkiacz987icpQHSzUIj2kkVEdCHqAfvoPElIOYfiak1vZnVN6J02BnlbvAGUA41Ks/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.申请人应保证填报信息、提交材料的真实性和准确性。凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实即取消申请资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.本夏令营属于非营利性质的文化交流活动，不收取任何费用。主办单位不承担参加者活动期间所产生的任何法律和经济责任。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3.夏令营参加者应自觉遵守夏令营期间的各项规定和要求，遵从工作人员的统一安排，不得从事与夏令营无关的任何活动。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>9</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 招收工作联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/uCo3BrN4ATo45dFnEIFjPJq3UNdm0CmeZWibOPXyrD0x0kvstxtIC5Ur3gv8icrvib2QxtWYUJNtibLcI0YiboianjNy4IU4OhpmZa6suAcmz7icyw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.联系电话：0531-89269583、0531-89269884</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.夏令营报名交流QQ群：952124413</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/uCo3BrN4ATqUMHpm2JToy8lDySJV7Buwc5Tk9SjUeaUOvGBSeZDBo19QRVabGMdCANNeawGUL0ZjUNTB6fbJvbibibTXicc2DYnrSIxYbjwqTo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/uCo3BrN4ATpicPVXoOAL7uILXKgmKkkZZej9CGNjYR3aRF3N4K1LJSsXYlAYF7aXcibnpXHLbEDnbepQT5bUhU5hFKicJYK9JOJqm7lWEPBBjo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>欢迎优秀本科生积极报名参与。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>期待这个夏天与你相遇！</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uCo3BrN4ATpfTc4abZS3tjD9mUMQeurFw03nOS0ajQDkzFJwf4KLcxpB7dEdhLyNiaT9sfOOrFX0MOdqB1mDHUPQtyAoYNs4nJFy4nKRdzwE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>往期推荐</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><span>RECOMMEND</span></span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5MTc0NTk4MA==&amp;mid=2247543487&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=13cf23c1a6114217614f4c10e177bfd9&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">山一大一附院（省千佛山医院）与山东省慈善总会签署小儿肝移植、儿童造血干细胞移植救助项目合作协议</a></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5MTc0NTk4MA==&amp;mid=2247543487&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=2bf2cd19a0d5d27ba09bebc36c967722&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">校（院）党委委员、山一大一附院（省千佛山医院）党委书记孙志坚讲授树立和践行正确政绩观专题党课</a></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5MTc0NTk4MA==&amp;mid=2247543487&amp;idx=3&amp;sn=cefec6febb3f02acc542a1af48c16ef7&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">直播预告：千医大讲堂（第八十期）小小创口，大大守护——小儿外科隐瘢痕微创技术</a></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/nSn2OpYoibfE78OHSUVX1zxgVya9rdhMNBohwxUhuhz8WZoZn8QOFQwThuoYicBC0fXoOqPY8MQIYZzarUvdicDzg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4\"/></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"53082f478d4f83c84e57f07dc865844f1e2897e1108e056f6d5fd666e5b200bd","textLength":2198,"sourceSha256":"6e2866ed4ff0d954a0602af1d982c750384d46e9570e520df6bd1943168a8fad","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-105e20eb9397e7690289","title":"2026年山东第一医科大学第一附属医院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:23.325157+00:00"}
